Kill [TAR7847 Caliph Scorpidsting] (46, not elite) for Caliph Scorpidsting's Head [QC2781] (~83%; if it does not drop, wait for his respawn) [G61.8,38.2 Tanaris]
At [TAR7407 Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle], [QT1691] (3,750 XP + 65s) [QT2781] (5,050 XP + 1g 30s) [G52.5,28.5 Tanaris]
