[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Gear (1707):|r the Gadgetzan Water Co. Care Package is fixed: open it (contents not in the data)
[O]Only if you carry Coming to Collect (95312): at [TAR220984 Fizbuz Mithril], [QT95312] (315 XP) [QA95321 Tazzik's Dues] (3,150 XP: confront Tazzik in Steamwheedle Port) [G51.7,27.8 Tanaris]
[O]Only with 95321: ride back to Steamwheedle Port (about 16 units) and confront [TAR260857 Tazzik] (level 40; whether he fights or talks is unverified) [QC95321] [G67.3,24.0 Tanaris]
[O]Only with 95321: at [TAR260857 Tazzik], [QT95321] (3,150 XP) [QA95472 Consolation Prize] (2,350 XP at the hand-in: Tazzik's Sweaty Shirt to Friz Frazzlespark at Powderfuse Port - chapter 48), then ride back to Gadgetzan [G67.3,24.0 Tanaris]
